{"id": "34520", "title": "城堡里没有公主", "author": "陈毓华", "category": "文学名著", "count": 45, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34520.htm", "intro": "明明犹似白雪公主的“睡”美人，为何老是“盖头盖脸”的自暴自弃样？令他这来自杜拜的21王子看了很不爽！别说他没给她机会，从低级打杂工升等为贴身女仆，伺候他穿穿脱脱，顺便将他看光光，可这矮冬瓜似乎没把他这主子看在眼里，还说她心上有个人，曾经伤她太深，他是男人耶，哪能容忍爱上的女人──心里有别狼！所以他问了：“你爱我吗？”这小妮子竟敢给他无言以对，吼，他扑倒她，狂野肆虐她的唇，没想到，她一逃逃到致命的沙漠去，像个垂死的破娃娃，狠狠揪著他的心……", "base": "files/article/html/34/34520", "chapters": [{"title": "序言", "file": "2190143.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第1页", "file": "2190144.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2190145.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2190146.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2190147.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2190148.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2190149.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2190150.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2190151.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2190152.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2190153.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2190154.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2190155.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2190156.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2190157.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2190158.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2190159.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2190160.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2190161.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2190162.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2190163.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2190164.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2190165.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "file": "2190166.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第24页", "file": "2190167.h